      },
      {
        "t": 18,
        "type": "ascii",
        "text": "  _____  ______ __  __  ____\n |  __ \\|  ____|  \\/  |/ __ \\\n | |  | | |__  | \\  / | |  | |\n | |  | |  __| | |\\/| | |  | |\n | |__| | |____| |  | | |__| |\n |_____/|______|_|  |_|\\____/\n"
